### Sample requests for the helpdesk sample (VS Code REST Client) - run `npm run watch` first
@server = http://localhost:4004
@auth = Basic alice:

### Incidents
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents?$expand=attachments($select=ID,filename,mimeType,size)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1. Create a draft
# @name incident
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Upload test" }

### 2. Create the attachment (metadata) - the media type is derived from the file name
# @name attachment
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/attachments
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "filename": "hello.txt" }

### 3. Upload the content (stored in MongoDB GridFS)
PUT {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/attachments(ID={{attachment.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/content
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from MongoDB GridFS!

### 3b. Single attachment (Composition of one): exists with the incident - just upload (replace = upload again)
PUT {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/approval/content
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/pdf
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="approval.pdf"

%PDF-1.4 signed approval

### 3c. Remove the file of the single attachment
# DELETE {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/approval/content
# Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4. Activate the draft
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/HelpdeskService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Download / view the content
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/attachments(ID={{attachment.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/content
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6. Not allowed: screenshots only accept images
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/HelpdeskService.draftEdit
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "PreserveChanges": true }

###
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/helpdesk/Incidents(ID={{incident.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/screenshots
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "filename": "report.pdf" }
